
Nimewo aprann: ['plus:'] vle-di: ['+'].
Nimewo lè: ['+'] fè: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x inite-mezi.
	(currency = ['euros']) vre: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (tèt-li plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars inite: ['dollars'].
euros inite: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Sòti ekri: money, nouvo-liy.
